              <li>✅ 100% OpenAI-compatible — zero SDK migration cost</li>
              <li>✅ Combined billing — one flat rate, no need to track input vs output separately</li>
              <li>✅ Domestic availability — ICP-filed, Alipay/WeChat Pay, mainland direct access</li>
              <li>✅ Founded by Dr. Kai-Fu Lee — strong research pedigree and open-source contributions</li>
              <li>✅ Streaming, function calling, JSON mode — all supported</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>Cons</strong></p>
            <ul>
